error[E0101]: `[` after `v` starts neither an index nor a comprehension
 --> variable-index.hsg:3:11
  |
3 | let a = v[i]
  |           ^ an index must be a natural number
  |
  = hint: indices are number literals, like `v[0]`; they can't be computed
  = hint: a call with a vector argument needs parentheses: `v([…])`

error[E0101]: `[` after `sum` starts neither an index nor a comprehension
 --> variable-index.hsg:4:14
  |
4 | let b = sum [v, v]
  |              ^ a comprehension needs `|` here
  |
  = hint: a call with a vector argument needs parentheses: `sum([…])`

2 errors
